Oh, lihat.

750
00:41:34.867 --> 00:41:35.868
Kenapa, eh…

751
00:41:36.952 --> 00:41:39.413
- Hah?
- Kenapa kamu masih di kursi depan?

752
00:41:39.497 --> 00:41:40.539
Oh.

753
00:41:41.582 --> 00:41:42.625
Anda tahu,

754
00:41:44.335 --> 00:41:45.794
